# Walkthrough - Module Hub Improvements

I have implemented a series of visual and functional improvements to the Module Hub on the dashboard and the Courses page to enhance information density and provide a "premium" user experience.

## Dashboard Improvements

- **Minimalist Identity**: Dashboard module cards now show **only module codes** for an ultra-clean, focused view.
- **Improved Hierarchy**: Increased card size (`min-h-[100px]`) and padding for a more premium presence.
- **Permanent Visibility**: All action buttons (New Task/Note and Footer actions) are now **permanently visible**. The pop-up animations and "hidden" nature have been removed for immediate access.
- **Quick Stats**: Prominent stat badges for pending tasks and assignments are always accessible.
- **Visual Polish**: Stronger hover states with shadow-lg and soft glow effects, without the clutter of moving parts.

![Dashboard Module Hub Permanent Buttons](/Users/oli/.gemini/antigravity/brain/d6637fe2-95f8-4984-b6e1-5dd76fc2c176/module_hub_verification_1772367015902.png)

## Module Detail Redesign (The Hub)

- **Vertical Navigation Sidebar**: Replaced horizontal tabs with a clean, low-opacity sidebar, allowing for more horizontal space for module-specific content.
- **Bento Grid Overview**: A modern, tile-based overview for at-a-glance information:
    - **Deadlines Tile**: Lists the next three critical deadlines.
    - **Pulse Tile**: Circular progress SVG tracking your module completion and current grade percentage.
    - **Meta Tile**: Quick access to Credits, Workload, and Exam details.
    - **Updates Tile**: A horizontal scroll for the latest module announcements.
- **Immersive Hero Aesthetics**: Large-scale background typography of the module code and subtle glassmorphism for a premium "Command Center" feel.
- **Responsive Navigation**: Seamlessly switch between Assignments, Announcements, Grades, and AI Chat within the new sidebar context.

![Module Bento Grid Overview](/Users/oli/.gemini/antigravity/brain/d6637fe2-95f8-4984-b6e1-5dd76fc2c176/bento_grid_overview_1772385605865.png)

