## Courses Page Improvements

- **Rich Metadata**: Course cards now display "Credits", "Exam Dates", and "Workload" (if available).
- **Consolidated Actions**: Changed "Hide/Show" to "Pin/Unpin" to clarify the action's effect on the dashboard.
- **Refined Layout**: Improved the grid layout and card headers for better readability.

